If a patient is an older-adult then every clinician should heed an additional-opioid-initiation-caution for the patient.
If a patient has a renal-insufficiency then every clinician should heed an additional-opioid-initiation-caution for the patient.
If a patient has a hepatic-insufficiency then every clinician should heed an additional-opioid-initiation-caution for the patient.
